    },
    {
      "question": "If my opponent activates \"OP01-026 Gum-Gum Fire- Fist Pistol Red Hawk\" during my turn, can I prevent this Character from being K.O.'d by the [Counter] effect of \"Gum-Gum Fire-Fist Pistol Red Hawk\" by activating this Character's effect first and increasing its power to 6000?",
